				8.8.4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέκρυσις</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>carrying off of moisture,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.9.8
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
